Runs are fully replayable.

Deployment & Safety Notice

R-MARBLE is not production-safe.

It may:

Produce uncalibrated probabilities

Generate overconfident synthesis

Rely on unstable schemas

Operate without human approval gates

Any production deployment must use P-MARBLE or an equivalent safety-constrained system.

